  </div>
</div>



    

                                                                            <div class="undefined">
  <div class="card">
    
      
    
    <div class="card-header">
        <a class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionWhatisareportableunsuccessfulattempt6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordionWhatisareportableunsuccessfulattempt6" href="#">
        What is a reportable unsuccessful attempt?
      </a>
    </div>
    <div id="accordionWhatisareportableunsuccessfulattempt6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="accordionblockWhatisareportableunsuccessfulattempt6" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample6">
      <div class="cms card-body">
        <p>An incident such as a BIN attack attempt that fails but reveals vulnerabilities (e.g., $0 test transactions) should still be reported.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>



    

                                                                            <div class="undefined">
  <div class="card">
    
      
    
    <div class="card-header">
        <a class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionHowoftenareintermediatereportsrequired6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordionHowoftenareintermediatereportsrequired6" href="#">
        How often are intermediate reports required?
      </a>
    </div>
    <div id="accordionHowoftenareintermediatereportsrequired6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="accordionblockHowoftenareintermediatereportsrequired6" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample6">
      <div class="cms card-body">
        <p>At least one is required after five days if unresolved. Additional reports may be requested by the FSC before or after this period.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>



    

                                                                            <div class="undefined">
  <div class="card">
    
      
    
    <div class="card-header">
        <a class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionWhatistheIncidentReportReferenceNumber6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordionWhatistheIncidentReportReferenceNumber6" href="#">
        What is the Incident Report Reference Number?
      </a>
    </div>
    <div id="accordionWhatistheIncidentReportReferenceNumber6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="accordionblockWhatistheIncidentReportReferenceNumber6" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample6">
      <div class="cms card-body">
        <p>A unique code assigned after Form 1 is submitted, used to track each incident.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>



    

                                      
                                    
                                                                
                                                            
                                            </div>
                </div>
                        
            
